msgid "磁类型如何识别"
msgstr "How magnetic types are identified"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7604
#: bb8a8a80f7e94542ac1ccfafb23f6e42
msgid "输入条件"
msgstr "Input requirements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7606
#: 4190a33561054e02b5998d77f40f9316
msgid "磁类型分析只读取逐原子的 `spin:R:3`，即每个原子一个三分量自旋向量："
msgstr "Magnetic-type analysis reads only per-atom `spin:R:3`: one three-component spin vector for each atom:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7608
#: 9d9b5ff876b84bcbaad5f8d1ce88bd28
msgid "Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:spin:R:3\n"
msgstr "Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:spin:R:3\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7612
#: 8674879be9a54eb6bed908dcef019035
msgid ""
"`spin` 必须是数值型 `N × 3` 数组，并且所有分量有限。`mforce` 和 `force_mag` 是磁力标签，不能替代 `spin`。缺少有效 "
"`spin` 的结构会单独显示为「无有效 spin 字段」，不会被猜成非磁结构。"
msgstr ""
"`spin` must be a numeric `N × 3` array with finite components. `mforce` and "
"`force_mag` are magnetic-force labels and cannot substitute for `spin`. Structures "
"without valid `spin` data are listed separately as `No valid spin field`; they are "
"not guessed to be nonmagnetic."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7614
#: 8a0457a262ec4cb79940c7213ea290d0
msgid "4 组判据"
msgstr "Four criteria"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7616
#: 6b903df5f5c540cd96e7a4460f4a4418
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"设第 $i$ 个自旋为 $\\mathbf s_i$，磁矩大小为 $m_i=\\lVert\\mathbf s_i\\rVert$，单位方向为 "
"$\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i=\\mathbf s_i/m_i$。小于等于 `1 × 10⁻⁷` 的磁矩不参与方向统计。"
msgstr ""
"Let $\\mathbf s_i$ be spin $i$, $m_i=\\lVert\\mathbf s_i\\rVert$ its magnitude, "
"and $\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i=\\mathbf s_i/m_i$ its unit direction. Moments less than "
"or equal to `1 × 10⁻⁷` are excluded from directional statistics."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7618
#: 44faaa49046d4ba3a1d921e3216c86f5
msgid "**净磁矩比例**"
msgstr "**Net-moment ratio**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7620
#: 0770e6379c42403e8a5efa32a225e449
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   R_M=\\frac{\\left\\lVert\\sum_i\\mathbf s_i\\right\\rVert}{\\sum_i\\lVert\\mathbf "
"s_i\\rVert}\n"
"   "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   R_M=\\frac{\\left\\lVert\\sum_i\\mathbf s_i\\right\\rVert}{\\sum_i\\lVert\\mathbf "
"s_i\\rVert}\n"
"   "

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7624
#: f6881753256348bea6af22056711b2c6
msgid "$R_M$ 接近 `1` 表示自旋净对齐，接近 `0` 表示整体补偿。它是无量纲比例；平均磁矩仍沿用输入 `spin` 的单位。"
msgstr "$R_M$ near `1` indicates net spin alignment, while a value near `0` indicates overall compensation. This ratio is dimensionless; the mean moment retains the units of the input `spin`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7626
#: 6034628dc89e4f4094763c6092b23746
msgid "**共线性与共面性**"
msgstr "**Collinearity and coplanarity**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7628
#: b2b7d498ac29401f8402d6bb17ee6b22
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   \\mathbf Q=\\frac{1}{N_s}\\sum_i\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i^{\\mathsf "
"T},\n"
"   \\qquad \\lambda_1\\le\\lambda_2\\le\\lambda_3\n"
"   "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   \\mathbf Q=\\frac{1}{N_s}\\sum_i\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i^{\\mathsf "
"T},\n"
"   \\qquad \\lambda_1\\le\\lambda_2\\le\\lambda_3\n"
"   "

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7633
#: ac0fb23b9694409bae7a99e67baa192c
msgid ""
"共线性取 $C=\\lambda_3$，共面性取 $P=1-3\\lambda_1$。$C$ 接近 `1` 表示方向集中在同一条轴上；$P$ 接近 `1` "
"表示方向主要位于同一平面。"
msgstr ""
"Collinearity is $C=\\lambda_3$, and coplanarity is $P=1-3\\lambda_1$. A value "
"of $C$ near `1` means the directions concentrate along one axis; a value of $P$ "
"near `1` means they lie mainly in one plane."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7635
#: e15e122830e54d5caa268a4df31a3805
msgid "**近邻自旋相关**"
msgstr "**Neighbor spin correlation**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7637
#: b461e556c1e4481385edd7de41bb8280
msgid "每个原子最多取 12 个最近邻，计算"
msgstr "For each atom, use at most 12 nearest neighbors to compute"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7639
#: a61272f1b25440c99757c4dc8745b344
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   \\bar c=\\left\\langle\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf "
"s}_j\\right\\rangle_{\\langle i,j\\rangle}\n"
"   "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   \\bar c=\\left\\langle\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf "
"s}_j\\right\\rangle_{\\langle i,j\\rangle}\n"
"   "

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7643
#: d71f485e57f9482b95c542f32fdeed3a
msgid "点积不小于 `0.80` 记为平行近邻，不大于 `-0.80` 记为反平行近邻。程序还分别统计平行和反平行近邻比例。"
msgstr "A dot product of at least `0.80` marks a parallel neighbor; one no greater than `-0.80` marks an antiparallel neighbor. The program also reports the parallel- and antiparallel-neighbor fractions separately."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7645
#: 140bde68b0734388894f9a08d0533971
msgid "**低阶磁结构因子**"
msgstr "**Low-order magnetic structure factor**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7647
#: f5ea1c919264489baaea80303b29ac7a
msgid "对分数坐标 $\\mathbf f_i$，程序在周期方向上扫描 $|h|,|k|,|l|\\le3$ 的非零整数波矢，计算"
msgstr "For fractional coordinates $\\mathbf f_i$, the program scans nonzero integer wavevectors with $|h|,|k|,|l|\\le3$ along periodic directions and computes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7649
#: 621be37c1d3d4562a960e390b3852d4f
msgid ""
"\n"
"   S(\\mathbf q)=\\min\\!\\left[1,\n"
"   \\frac{2\\left\\lVert\\sum_i\\mathbf s_i\n"
"   \\exp\\!\\left(\\mathrm i2\\pi\\mathbf q\\cdot\\mathbf "
"f_i\\right)\\right\\rVert^2}\n"
"   {\\left(\\sum_i m_i\\right)^2}\\right]\n"
"   "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   S(\\mathbf q)=\\min\\!\\left[1,\n"
"   \\frac{2\\left\\lVert\\sum_i\\mathbf s_i\n"
"   \\exp\\!\\left(\\mathrm i2\\pi\\mathbf q\\cdot\\mathbf "
"f_i\\right)\\right\\rVert^2}\n"
"   {\\left(\\sum_i m_i\\right)^2}\\right]\n"
"   "

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7656
#: 8ddba0e65c9048a0be249e4d2645fd34
#, python-brace-format
msgid "页面记录最大值 $S_\\mathrm{max}$ 及对应的整数波矢。它用于识别当前超胞内可分辨的低阶调制，不是连续 reciprocal-space 扫描。"
msgstr "The page records the maximum $S_\\mathrm{max}$ and its integer wavevector. This identifies low-order modulations resolvable in the current supercell; it is not a continuous reciprocal-space scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7658
#: efa9800605444ad3b45efd22d6074404
msgid "结构级磁类型标签"
msgstr "Structure-level magnetic-type labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7660
#: 34a76e4bc3ba4339819d8035fd6a0f25
msgid "判定按下表从上到下执行："
msgstr "The criteria are applied from top to bottom in the table:"

