#, python-brace-format
msgid "$C\\ge0.90$、$R_M<0.82$、反平行近邻比例至少 `0.20`，并且 $S_\\mathrm{max}\\ge0.35$ 或 $\\bar c<-0.05$"
msgstr "$C\\ge0.90$, $R_M<0.82$, and an antiparallel-neighbor fraction of at least `0.20`, plus either $S_\\mathrm{max}\\ge0.35$ or $\\bar c<-0.05$"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-magnetism.md:8
#: 267ee8346b90435b90f751a5b62e20b2
msgid "其他非共线"
msgstr "Other noncollinear"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-magnetism.md:8
#: 0d85d10b698a464988194ed81eb22e5a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$C<0.90$，且满足 $S_\\mathrm{max}\\ge0.45$ 与 $P\\ge0.72$；或满足 "
"$S_\\mathrm{max}\\ge0.32$、$\\lvert\\bar c\\rvert\\ge0.30$ 中的任一项"
msgstr ""
"$C<0.90$ and either both $S_\\mathrm{max}\\ge0.45$ and $P\\ge0.72$, or at "
"least one of $S_\\mathrm{max}\\ge0.32$ and $\\lvert\\bar c\\rvert\\ge0.30$"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-magnetism.md:8
#: f6eb1f7d28e54a57937aef0a31359ccf
msgid "PM-like（自旋无序）"
msgstr "PM-like (spin-disordered)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-magnetism.md:8
#: fedd50aedc9c4102a7261830815e46da
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$R_M\\le0.25$、$S_\\mathrm{max}\\le0.22$ 且 $\\lvert\\bar c\\rvert\\le0.15$"
msgstr "$R_M\\le0.25$, $S_\\mathrm{max}\\le0.22$, and $\\lvert\\bar c\\rvert\\le0.15$"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7672
#: 8c3162f0c1ed4027885e8e79b3e2e098
msgid ""
"只有结构级结果已经属于 AFM，程序才继续检查层序。它沿周期晶格方向用分数坐标聚合磁层；同一方向上分数坐标间隔不超过 `0.025` "
"的原子归入同一层，层内极化绝对值必须至少为 `0.80`。层序细分至少需要 4 个有效磁矩原子。一个完整的周期 `↑↓` 标为「逐层 AFM」，`↑↑↓↓` 标为「双层 "
"AFM」。周期边界会继续重复该层序，因此不要求同一晶胞内再出现第二遍。没有通过层序门槛的 AFM 显示为「AFM（未细分）」。"
msgstr ""
"The program checks layer order only after the structure-level result is AFM. It "
"groups magnetic layers along periodic lattice directions using fractional "
"coordinates: atoms separated by no more than `0.025` in the same direction belong "
"to one layer, whose absolute polarization must be at least `0.80`. Layer-order "
"classification requires at least four atoms with valid moments. One complete `↑↓` "
"period is labeled `Layer-by-layer AFM`, and `↑↑↓↓` is labeled `Double-layer AFM`. "
"Because the sequence repeats across the periodic boundary, a second copy need not "
"appear in the same cell. AFM structures that do not pass the layer-order thresholds "
"are shown as `AFM (not further classified)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7674
#: f67574c5ebe74dc38792c3dacef01ee7
msgid ""
"逐元素结果使用相同的净磁矩、方向张量、同元素近邻相关和结构因子，给出「对齐」「补偿」「调制」「非共线」「混合共线」「无序」等快照标签。异元素近邻耦合按平均点积判断：不小于"
" `0.50` 为平行，不大于 `-0.50` 为反平行，其余为混合。"
msgstr ""
"Per-element results use the same net moment, orientation tensor, same-element "
"neighbor correlation, and structure factor to assign snapshot labels such as "
"`Aligned`, `Compensated`, `Modulated`, `Noncollinear`, `Mixed collinear`, and "
"`Disordered`. Coupling between unlike-element neighbors is classified by the mean "
"dot product: at least `0.50` is parallel, no greater than `-0.50` is antiparallel, "
"and all other values are mixed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7676
#: 1c07a36072394617a1f1f75ccc17dca0
msgid "磁类型标签的边界"
msgstr "Limits of the magnetic-type labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:7678
#: 7e7d85314385479e881beec8b3d9c4e6
msgid ""
"这些标签描述单帧自旋快照，不是有限温度磁相判定。`PM-like` 只表示这一帧在当前判据下呈现低净磁矩、低 q "
"峰和弱近邻相关，不能据此声明热力学顺磁相。波矢扫描只覆盖当前超胞可表示的低阶整数点；非公度螺旋、更长周期调制、强缺陷结构或尺寸很小的结构可能落入「其他非共线」或「未识别」。判断相变温度、磁畴稳定性或自由能仍需要独立模拟和物理验证。"
msgstr ""
"These labels describe a single-frame spin snapshot; they do not identify a finite-"
"temperature magnetic phase. `PM-like` means only that this frame has a low net "
"moment, weak q peak, and weak neighbor correlation under the current criteria; it "
"does not establish a thermodynamic paramagnetic phase. The wavevector scan covers "
"only low-order integer points representable by the current supercell. Incommensurate "
"spirals, longer-period modulations, heavily defective structures, or very small "
"structures may be classified as `Other noncollinear` or `Unrecognized`. Transition "
"temperatures, magnetic-domain stability, and free energies still require independent "
"simulation and physical validation."
